WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:06.214
I have a very strong sense
of identity in my blindness.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.844
One of the misconceptions that people
have about blind people is that we don't

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:13.805
care about how we look or the way
we present ourselves to the world.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:19.185
The Ray-Ban Meta Glasses allows me
to still look fashionable and be able

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.604
to do the tasks that I need
done as a blind person. 

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:22.897
- Hey, Meta

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:24.733
call a volunteer with Be My Eyes.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:25.900
- Calling a volunteer.

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.653
- Hey there. How can I help?

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:32.991
- Hi, I just got a new record player and I
wanted to see if you could help me figure

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.118
out which of these buttons turns it on.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:37.370
- Absolutely. I think it's the one on the bottom.
Try that. 

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.329
- This one here? 

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:39.330
- Yeah, that's it.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.499
- Perfect. Thank you.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:50.675
- Being able to connect with a human
through the Be My Eyes Call feature makes

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:51.718
a world of difference.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.427
- How can I help?

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.888
- Hi, I'm going to a salsa night
later today... 

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:59.100
- I'm able to ask follow-up questions and get
more detailed information.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.352
- Try the next one. Found it.

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:05.565
- The benefits to using Be My Eyes
through the glasses is being able to be

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:08.902
hands-free. As somebody that uses a cane,

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:12.572
I love being independent. That
makes a huge difference. 

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:16.993
- Hi, I was wondering if you could just give
me a spot check to see if I missed anything. 

00:01:16.993 --> 00:01:20.747
- Yes, I'm taking a look. You
look amazing. It looks perfect. 

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.332
- Oh, thank you so much.

00:01:28.296 --> 00:01:30.965
- I'm already like a very active,

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:36.221
extroverted person and I
feel like the glasses help me

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:38.306
be able to be that even more.

00:01:39.474 --> 00:01:44.145
I think the Ray-Ban Meta Glasses will
make a huge difference in people being

00:01:44.145 --> 00:01:47.857
able to use the tools that they need to
live the lives that they want to live.

